{
  "about": "Each case is a JSON document as a producer writes it and, for each digest encoding, the bytes that encoding writes for it (hex) or the reason it refuses. Written by scripts/json-encoding-differential-test.py --write from the Python implementations, held to them by the same script, held to the Go encoders by corpora/pyjson_table_test.go and corpora/w3cjcs_test.go, and held to the Rust W3C reader by a unit test in readers/w3c-report-rs/src/json.rs. Never edit by hand.",
